1
00:01:40,680 --> 00:01:41,479
Tang Zhiluo.

2
00:01:45,759 --> 00:01:47,000
Do you know?

3
00:01:52,160 --> 00:01:53,920
Before I met you,

4
00:01:59,880 --> 00:02:02,320
I never trusted anyone.

5
00:02:04,560 --> 00:02:07,160
You made me feel what love is.

6
00:02:12,200 --> 00:02:14,320
You can't just walk away.

7
00:02:18,640 --> 00:02:20,360
You can't leave me like this.

8
00:02:23,920 --> 00:02:24,880
Do you hear me?

9
00:02:27,720 --> 00:02:28,760
Do you hear me?

10
00:02:30,640 --> 00:02:32,120
You can't leave me alone.

11
00:02:32,120 --> 00:02:33,079
Do you hear me?

12
00:03:27,680 --> 00:03:29,810
Your Highness, Miss Tang has arrived.

13
00:03:30,480 --> 00:03:31,880
I am Tang Zhiluo.

14
00:03:32,320 --> 00:03:33,720
Greetings, Prince Shuo.

15
00:03:36,400 --> 00:03:37,240
Bring her up.

16
00:04:16,600 --> 00:04:17,959
Your Highness, there is no need to test me.

17
00:04:17,959 --> 00:04:19,279
I am indeed blind.

18
00:04:21,640 --> 00:04:22,920
I am only blind,

19
00:04:23,080 --> 00:04:25,080
not completely devoid of my senses.

20
00:04:25,120 --> 00:04:28,000
Besides, when you wave your arm in front of me,

21
00:04:28,280 --> 00:04:30,360
I can not only feel the air flow,

22
00:04:30,720 --> 00:04:32,600
but also hear the wind.

23
00:04:33,800 --> 00:04:35,330
Miss Tang, you are so young,

24
00:04:36,240 --> 00:04:37,400
but my brother

25
00:04:38,120 --> 00:04:40,380
said your medical skills are brilliant,

26
00:04:40,440 --> 00:04:42,159
like Hua Tuo reborn.

27
00:04:42,760 --> 00:04:44,560
I wonder if I have poor judgment,

28
00:04:44,920 --> 00:04:46,720
or if the world is full of people fishing for fame

29
00:04:46,720 --> 00:04:48,480
and bluffing.

30
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:50,159
Prince Yu, you flatter me.

31
00:04:50,400 --> 00:04:52,480
I don't deserve it.

32
00:04:53,840 --> 00:04:56,080
However, 'Hua Tuo reborn'

33
00:04:56,400 --> 00:04:57,930
describes medical skills,

34
00:04:58,080 --> 00:04:59,200
not age.

35
00:04:59,960 --> 00:05:02,220
Otherwise, you could just find a turtle.

36
00:05:02,640 --> 00:05:03,400
Wouldn't that be better?

37
00:05:03,400 --> 00:05:05,280
We have never met before.

38
00:05:06,160 --> 00:05:09,360
Why do you want to treat me?

39
00:05:10,200 --> 00:05:11,640
A healer has a benevolent heart.

40
00:05:11,640 --> 00:05:14,040
I can't bear to see patients suffer.

41
00:05:17,920 --> 00:05:19,560
You are blind.

42
00:05:20,960 --> 00:05:24,360
How can you see my suffering?

43
00:05:29,080 --> 00:05:30,560
Your Highness suffers from headaches,

44
00:05:30,560 --> 00:05:32,240
and I suffer from blindness.

45
00:05:32,400 --> 00:05:33,440
As fellow patients,

46
00:05:33,440 --> 00:05:35,240
I can naturally empathize with you.

47
00:05:35,240 --> 00:05:36,560
In that case,

48
00:05:38,040 --> 00:05:41,040
you may stay in my mansion.

49
00:05:42,800 --> 00:05:44,920
Then I will trouble Your Highness.

50
00:05:47,240 --> 00:05:48,800
Miss Tang, follow me.

51
00:05:48,800 --> 00:05:49,560
Thank you.

52
00:05:55,920 --> 00:05:57,720
What a hypocrite.

53
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:02,240
I want to see how long you can keep up this act.

54
00:06:07,640 --> 00:06:10,240
When did Your Highness's headaches start?

55
00:06:14,840 --> 00:06:17,480
Miss Tang, your medical skills are outstanding.

56
00:06:17,480 --> 00:06:18,920
Can't you diagnose it?

57
00:06:19,360 --> 00:06:21,290
I only know how to treat illnesses.

58
00:06:21,360 --> 00:06:22,620
I don't tell fortunes.

59
00:06:23,080 --> 00:06:24,940
Then what can Miss Tang diagnose?

60
00:06:27,680 --> 00:06:29,840
Spleen deficiency and liver stagnation.

61
00:06:29,840 --> 00:06:31,720
Phlegm and dampness clouding the upper body.

62
00:06:31,720 --> 00:06:32,680
What does that mean?

63
00:06:32,680 --> 00:06:34,010
You overthink too much.

64
00:06:34,200 --> 00:06:35,730
And you are too suspicious.

65
00:06:43,280 --> 00:06:45,480
Then, Miss Tang, can you cure it?

66
00:06:48,040 --> 00:06:49,320
Of course I can.

67
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:52,640
Your Highness only needs one acupuncture session,

68
00:06:52,640 --> 00:06:54,170
and a few doses of medicine.

69
00:06:54,520 --> 00:06:56,600
Your condition should improve.

70
00:06:58,760 --> 00:07:00,440
I think the acupuncture

71
00:07:02,400 --> 00:07:03,800
can wait for another day.

72
00:07:05,520 --> 00:07:07,320
What, is Your Highness afraid?

73
00:07:13,840 --> 00:07:16,570
Fine, Your Highness can take the medicine first.

74
00:07:16,640 --> 00:07:19,040
We'll talk about acupuncture another day.

75
00:07:43,400 --> 00:07:46,640
As they say, it's hard to guard against villains.

76
00:07:47,720 --> 00:07:50,280
Since Your Highness is still so childish,

77
00:07:50,480 --> 00:07:52,680
it shows your condition isn't serious.

78
00:07:53,360 --> 00:07:54,440
Just take your medicine on time.

79
00:07:54,440 --> 00:07:55,480
Given time,

80
00:07:55,640 --> 00:07:57,440
your condition should improve.

81
00:07:57,960 --> 00:08:00,000
Then I shall take my leave.

82
00:08:12,840 --> 00:08:13,800
Oh, my.

83
00:08:16,200 --> 00:08:18,400
I didn't expect you to end up like this.

84
00:08:19,200 --> 00:08:20,000
Shut up.

85
00:08:32,720 --> 00:08:34,679
Miss Tang, let me do it.

86
00:08:35,039 --> 00:08:36,640
It's not convenient for you.

87
00:08:37,679 --> 00:08:40,210
It's not that I don't trust you, Miss Yunling.

88
00:08:40,880 --> 00:08:43,409
But brewing medicine is also a doctor's duty.

89
00:08:43,600 --> 00:08:45,720
Only by controlling the heat in real time

90
00:08:45,720 --> 00:08:47,520
can the best effect be achieved.

91
00:08:47,960 --> 00:08:50,680
Miss Tang, you are so good to His Highness.

92
00:08:51,200 --> 00:08:54,130
Better than those imperial doctors from the palace.

93
00:09:37,160 --> 00:09:39,560
Your Highness, please take your medicine.

94
00:09:42,080 --> 00:09:43,480
How did you know it was me?

95
00:09:46,080 --> 00:09:46,520
Right.

96
00:09:47,560 --> 00:09:48,920
You are only blind.

97
00:09:49,440 --> 00:09:51,300
You haven't lost all five senses.

98
00:09:52,480 --> 00:09:54,740
You must have felt the flow of air, right?

99
00:09:57,400 --> 00:09:58,260
It's the smell.

100
00:10:56,480 --> 00:10:58,210
I only know how to treat people.

101
00:10:58,320 --> 00:10:59,520
I don't treat plants.

102
00:11:00,080 --> 00:11:01,720
I left the prescription on the stove.

103
00:11:01,720 --> 00:11:03,600
Please brew and take it yourself, Your Highness.

104
00:11:03,600 --> 00:11:05,560
Do not delay the treatment.

105
00:11:50,200 --> 00:11:51,000
Miss Tang,

106
00:11:51,920 --> 00:11:54,080
His Highness invites you to the lake to enjoy the water lanterns.

107
00:11:54,080 --> 00:11:57,080
He specially asked Yunling to bring you some clothes.

108
00:11:57,480 --> 00:11:58,940
Enjoy the water lanterns?

109
00:12:04,760 --> 00:12:05,760
I understand.

110
00:12:06,200 --> 00:12:07,600
Please tell His Highness

111
00:12:08,160 --> 00:12:09,960
that I will definitely be there.

112
00:12:23,720 --> 00:12:25,120
I humiliated her so much.

113
00:12:26,320 --> 00:12:27,280
Will she come,

114
00:12:28,000 --> 00:12:29,240
or leave in anger?

115
00:12:39,800 --> 00:12:40,660
Your Highness.

116
00:12:41,480 --> 00:12:42,680
Miss Tang, you're here.

117
00:12:42,680 --> 00:12:43,740
Please have a seat.

118
00:13:04,240 --> 00:13:05,040
I'm sorry.

119
00:13:06,360 --> 00:13:08,040
I just felt that this ribbon

120
00:13:08,040 --> 00:13:09,100
didn't quite match

121
00:13:10,680 --> 00:13:11,600
your outfit.

122
00:13:13,040 --> 00:13:14,080
It's fine.

123
00:13:14,080 --> 00:13:16,280
As long as I didn't scare Your Highness.

124
00:13:20,440 --> 00:13:22,080
I originally thought your eyes

125
00:13:22,080 --> 00:13:23,400
were blind from birth.

126
00:13:25,120 --> 00:13:27,880
I was wondering where you learned your medical skills.

127
00:13:27,880 --> 00:13:29,010
Little did I know...

128
00:13:29,680 --> 00:13:32,480
Half a year ago, I went up the mountain to gather herbs

129
00:13:32,480 --> 00:13:34,200
and accidentally fell off a cliff.

130
00:13:34,200 --> 00:13:36,130
Not only did I lose all my memories,

131
00:13:36,600 --> 00:13:39,040
but my eyes were also pierced by thorns.

132
00:13:41,400 --> 00:13:42,600
My royal brother said

133
00:13:43,280 --> 00:13:45,280
your medical skills are excellent.

134
00:13:46,600 --> 00:13:48,520
Can't you cure your own eyes?

135
00:13:49,280 --> 00:13:51,760
A doctor can hardly treat herself.

136
00:13:55,920 --> 00:13:57,920
Your Highness invited me to enjoy the lanterns.

137
00:13:57,920 --> 00:13:58,880
Where are they?

138
00:14:02,360 --> 00:14:04,960
Are you naturally incapable of getting angry,

139
00:14:06,520 --> 00:14:08,650
or are you just too good at pretending?

140
00:14:10,360 --> 00:14:11,690
How could I not be angry?

141
00:14:12,400 --> 00:14:14,560
Your Highness teased me during the day,

142
00:14:14,560 --> 00:14:16,620
and I called you a despicable person.

143
00:14:16,920 --> 00:14:18,650
Have you forgotten so quickly?

144
00:14:21,040 --> 00:14:23,160
It's just that you wanted to humiliate me,

145
00:14:23,160 --> 00:14:24,440
and I don't care.

146
00:14:25,280 --> 00:14:27,720
A doctor treats both the body and the mind.

147
00:14:28,080 --> 00:14:30,480
If Your Highness can cooperate with the treatment because of this,

148
00:14:30,480 --> 00:14:32,520
why wouldn't I do it?

149
00:14:34,000 --> 00:14:34,860
It was my fault.

150
00:14:36,120 --> 00:14:37,200
I apologize to you.

151
00:14:39,200 --> 00:14:40,000
How about

152
00:14:41,360 --> 00:14:42,960
I promise you one condition?

153
00:14:43,160 --> 00:14:46,000
Then Your Highness should cooperate with the treatment.

154
00:14:46,000 --> 00:14:46,960
Except for that.

155
00:14:50,840 --> 00:14:54,960
Then Your Highness can count the river lanterns for me.

156
00:14:55,320 --> 00:14:56,450
Count the lanterns?

157
00:14:57,040 --> 00:14:58,960
Is that not okay either?

158
00:14:59,840 --> 00:15:00,880
Then,

159
00:15:01,520 --> 00:15:02,920
I'll count the lanterns.

160
00:15:05,880 --> 00:15:06,680
Follow me.

161
00:15:38,720 --> 00:15:39,520
We're here.

162
00:15:40,920 --> 00:15:43,520
I'll count the lanterns, and you walk forward.

163
00:15:46,320 --> 00:15:47,120
One.

164
00:15:50,960 --> 00:15:51,760
Two.

165
00:15:55,920 --> 00:15:56,920
Three.

166
00:15:58,360 --> 00:16:00,640
I want to see if you're faking it.

167
00:16:01,680 --> 00:16:02,680
Four.

168
00:16:06,600 --> 00:16:07,240
Could it be

169
00:16:08,240 --> 00:16:09,400
that she really can't see?
